  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/IMG_4157.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(16 fotos) El restaurante del Gran Hotel Toledo, en la calle Argelita de Onda, abre excepcionalmente este domingo, 25 de febrero, a la hora de la comida para que puedan disfrutar del men&uacute; de las jornadas de cocina de alcachofa aquellas personas que no pueden hacerlo de lunes a s&aacute;bado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4143.jpg\" alt=\"img_4143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4144.jpg\" alt=\"img_4144\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4146.jpg\" alt=\"img_4146\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4147.jpg\" alt=\"img_4147\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4150.jpg\" alt=\"img_4150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4154.jpg\" alt=\"img_4154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4157.jpg\" alt=\"img_4157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4159.jpg\" alt=\"img_4159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescuinacarxofatoledo18/img_4160.jpg\" alt=\"img_4160\" style=\"m